# 🚫 `.gitignore` for Mini Project

Create:

`Day_39_API_Basics/Mini_Project_Smart_Weather_System/.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Virtual environment
venv/
.venv/
env/

# Environment variables / API keys
.env

# IDE files
.idea/
.vscode/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp